<title>USA: South Africa's O'okiep Copper 1995 results.</title>
<headline>South Africa's O'okiep Copper 1995 results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Okiep Copper Co Ltd on Tuesday filed revised Form 20-F for 1995 in which it reported operating profit of R57,053, compared with R25,204 the previous year.</p>
<p>The company also reported net income rose to R55,347 from R22,121 in 1994. The profit came on revenues of R261,316, compared with R181,600.</p>
<p>The company said in October it submitted the 20-F to the wrong office. It said the extensive work needed to ensure compliance with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission caused a delay in resubmitting the form.</p>
<p>			1995			1994</p>
<p> Operating profitR57,053		  R25,204</p>
<p> Net		 R55,347		  R22,121</p>
<p> Revs		R261,316		 R181,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs primaryN/A			N/A</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers.)</p>
<p>Results are revised for 1995 compared with 1994.</p>
</text>
